// Module evaluation: static package sugar uses PackageSugar; computed fields
// use ComputedFields and the shared comptime evaluator before the merge engine.
// This Rust module contains module declarations and public imports, not a
// second evaluator. Jet's package source discovery publishes the canonical
// declarations below directly; do not duplicate them or add re-export shims.
// Test anchors and the remaining full-strength claim are in
// Tests/ModuleEval/EnvPlanBuilder01.jet.

